@sandom/image-codecs
Copyright 2026 DevBlanket AB

Image decoder runtime dependencies

dist/jpeg.wasm contains unmodified zune-jpeg 0.5.15, zune-core 0.5.1,
dlmalloc 0.2.14 and cfg-if 1.0.4.

dist/webp.wasm contains unmodified image-webp 0.2.4, byteorder-lite 0.1.0
and quick-error 2.0.1.

This package uses the MIT terms of each crate. The complete license texts
that each crate offers are in docs/legal/licenses/rust-crates/, which ships
with the package. docs/legal/image-decoders.md records the versions, the
lockfile digests and the build procedure.
